{
  "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang",
  "chapter": 1,
  "act": 1,
  "scene": "zhaoyang",
  "palette": "gold",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "shenheng",
    "tangjian"
  ],
  "require": {
    "flag.petition_sent": true
  },
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "补件不能抹去原牒，首次核问已经沿细节指向阿荻",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "出了那道门，你赶向昭阳殿送补件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l2",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你跑上石阶，鞋里都是水，袖子贴着仍在发酸的手臂。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l3",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "刚送来的呈文，我要补一句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l4",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l5",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "写阿荻的事，没问过她。后面抄的都得带上这句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l6",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "原件已收进去了，你补的这句赶上了后抄这一份。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l7",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "原件上还没有？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l8",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "能添上，不能抽走原件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l9",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "阿荻知道写了多少？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "只念了例证，宋才人陪她，我先来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "把副本带回去，一条一条说给她听，别只说追过了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "副本我带回去，一条条说给她听。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l14",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她还没问完，都在那里等着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你跨过积水，袖中留着阿荻要你照录的两句话，没有替她润色。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l16",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她听完了，准我补两句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l17",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "哪两句？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l18",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "衣是她送的，她没许我把私下的话写进呈文。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l19",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我照写。但原文已经另抄了一份送走。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l20",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那一份还没带上更正。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l21",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "还得把更正送去，已经来不及跟原文一道。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l22",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她还说什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l23",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "后面的话，等她自己讲。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l24",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l25",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "只带来她准的两句，别替她补满。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l26",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "就这两句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l27",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "昭阳殿檐口还在滴雨，缺耳尖的马等着回厩，鼻息吹动湿鬃。",
      "image": "e39_ch01_s18_l27"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l28",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "它听见空桶挪动，又偏了一下头；没有因为那日停过试就不再怕响。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l29",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你正要去碰马，唐简已把衙署送回的答复展开。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l30",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "回来了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l31",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "他们有答复了？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l32",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "叫我何时来？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l33",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没先叫你。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l34",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l35",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "沈衡移开挡光的手。那一行字完整地露出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l36",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "初八西库的十一件旧衣，要先问是谁送来的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l37",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "提出人是我，先叫我——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l38",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "经手人是她。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l39",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l40",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "日期、库名、件数，已足够找过去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l41",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你按住冰冷的湿袖口，那里还留着阿荻替你改的针脚。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l42",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我没问她就引了私话，也记下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l43",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这件……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l44",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我擅自写她的事，别只记成她来讨欠钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l45",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "记下了，原文和更正何时送来，也都记着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l46",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她在补件旁添下时刻，另取一份，不去抹原牒。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l47",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "叫阿荻来问话的人，已往掖庭去了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l48",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l49",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "马蹄在阶下挪了一步，你却望向来时那道门。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l50",
      "who": "empty",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "门槛外的日光只剩窄窄一条，照着石面上的旧车辙。",
      "image": "e39_ch01_s18_l50"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l51",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你收起副本，转身往掖庭去。"
    }
  ],
  "chapterEnd": true,
  "goto": "ch02_s01_yeting"
}
